???: Run... little one... you must run...

???: The sea... it's coming to claim the valley!

???: It's angry... and nothing here can stop it.

???: The shelter will not hold. The trees cannot protect you.

OLLIE: Who's there?

???: Ollie...

OLLIE: How do you know my name?

???: I've been watching... listening...

???: The water is rising. It won't stop until everything is swallowed.

OLLIE: No... That's not true.

OLLIE: The rescuers will come. They always come.

???: They will come... but will they come in time?

OLLIE: Stop it! Tatay said our trees would keep us safe!

???: The trees...

???: They will bend. They will break.

???: And when the water comes, they will be swallowed whole.

OLLIE: No! You're lying!

???: Then listen, little one.

#[A faint rumbling grows louder in the distance.]

OLLIE: ...

OLLIE: I can hear something...

???: Take your siblings and run to the hills... before the dawn breaks!

???: Don't wait for the water to reach your door.

???: Don't wait for someone to tell you it's time.

???: Run...

OLLIE: The sea?

OLLIE: But the sea is far away...

OLLIE: It's behind the highway. How can it come all the way here?

OLLIE: But Tatay said the trees are strong...

OLLIE: They're protecting us...

OLLIE: ...Right?

#[The rumbling grows into the sound of rushing water. The floor trembles beneath Ollie's feet.]

OLLIE: Make it stop...

OLLIE: Please...

#[The sound of rushing water swells, drowning out everything else.]

Who is telling the truth?

#[FADE TO BLACK]

























Entity: [shake rate=18 level=6]...O...llie...[/shake]

Ollie: Who's there?

