Ollie: Show yourself!

Entity: [shake rate=15 level=5]I have been here since before the rain.[/shake]
Entity: [shake rate=15 level=5]I am in the walls. In the pipes. In the water.[/shake]

Ollie: What do you want?

Entity: [shake rate=22 level=7]To warn you.[/shake]
Entity: [shake rate=25 level=10]The water is not done rising.[/shake]
Entity: [speed=0.4]It never is.[/speed]

